; First Steps in Vietnamese / Tiếng Việt (vi)
; MultiLang-ASM Kids
; ==========================================

dat hop 10       ; Put 10 candies in the box
them hop 5        ; Get 5 more candies (15)
tru hop 2        ; Eat 2 candies (13 left!)
hien hop         ; Show the final candy count!
